"Essaie : tes décisions, ta somme","panneau":"Droits et lois","texte":"§ Essaie : tes décisions, ta somme Le droit de contester une déduction (proposition P15 du dossier) commence par un geste simple : tes décisions se consignent comme une chaîne. Chaque nouvelle décision s’ajoute à la somme des précédentes — les anciennes restent lisibles, marquées non exécutoires ; la dernière commande. Essaie : Je décide : OUI Je décide : NON Recommencer la démo Aucune décision pour le moment — la somme est à zéro. Rien ne s’efface. La dernière décision commande. Démonstration locale : rien n’est conservé, rien ne quitte ton appareil. Dans ton suivi, le même mécanisme consigne tes vraies décisions : Agir et suivi .","mots":["essaie","tes","decisions","ta","somme","le","droit","de","contester","une","deduction","proposition","p15","du","dossier","commence","par","un","geste","simple","tes","decisions","se","consignent","comme","une","chaine","chaque","nouvelle","decision","s","ajoute","a","la","somme","des","precedentes","les","anciennes","restent","lisibles","marquees","non","executoires","la","derniere","commande","essaie","je","decide","oui","je","decide","non","recommencer","la","demo","aucune","decision","pour","le","moment","la","somme","est","a","zero","rien","ne","s","efface","la","derniere","decision","commande","demonstration","locale","rien","n","est","conserve","rien","ne","quitte","ton","appareil","dans","ton","suivi","le","meme","mecanisme","consigne","tes","vraies","decisions","agir","et","suivi"],"empreinte":"14dd23eca0868afe72c9f3be76103ca2036701b3679a7635b9ee166c1adc2173","actions":[{"libelle":"Essayer la démo — tes décisions, ta somme","page":"droits.html","ancre":"demo-decisions","fragment":"Essaie : tes décisions, ta somme","mots":["essayer","demo","decisions","somme","essaie"]}],"merkle":{"feuille":103,"chemin":[{"cote":"gauche","digest":"5e01538cc36e465ba9eff8398d718e491a1d312cd107e78aa21a4a8a046b6f40"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"b52563e0d9a8b27e8a5ed257be42